BetterMacField contains the project's integration and launcher source code.
The MIT license applies to that source code. Identifiers, interface names,
layout information and short expected-byte fingerprints identify supported
client implementations; they do not represent ownership of the game.

Arknights: Endfield game content and trademarks belong to their respective
rights holders. PlayCover/PlayTools and Apple's Metal/MetalFX remain separate
components with their own terms. They are not bundled in this repository.

The full-feature launcher package contains rendering programs prepared from
a verified global iOS 1.7.2 game export: adapted character/scene lighting
programs, original GTAO/contact kernels, and motion/depth binding metadata.
These inputs stay outside the tracked MIT tree under build/Graphics172 and
are not relicensed under MIT. The preparation helper consumes a prepared
local export; it is not an extractor for arbitrary player installations.

No models, textures, game scene chunks, Unity asset bundles, IPA files or MOD
payloads are included in this launcher package. The macOS executable bundle
named BetterMacFieldGraphics.bundle contains project integration code and
the prepared rendering programs described above. The application icon is
included with the project source.
